# Always commit and push

After meaningful app changes in this repo, **commit and push without waiting to be asked**.

1. Commit relevant code/data (never `toast-session*.bak`, secrets, or credential dumps).
2. Push the current branch to `origin`.
3. Also update GitHub Pages: `git push origin HEAD:main` (Pages serves from `main`).
4. Tell the user the commit hash and that live Pages will refresh shortly.
